  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Rinse the herring fillets and pat them dry.",
    "Heat the coconut oil in an oven-safe skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until translucent, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for another minute.",
    "Add the curry paste and cook for 1-2 minutes, until fragrant.",
    "Add the herring fillets and cook for 2-3 minutes on each side.",
    "Transfer the skillet to the preheated oven and bake for 8-10 minutes, or until the herring is cooked through.",
    "Remove from the oven and sprinkle with thyme, outstandingly spicy pepper, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy!"
